        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1496_5385.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpärlich</unclear> willig dienst, sambt was
<lb n="2"/>wir ehren, liebs, und guots vermögend zuovor, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frome</unclear>, fürsichtige,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsame</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weiße</unclear> insonders guote <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>, und getrüwe liebe
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpären</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eß</unclear> habend unß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beßonders</unclear> liebe, und getrüwe
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">raathßgesandte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtßhäuptman</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Conradt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zäner</unclear></persName> von <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Haimen</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bollenstain</unclear></placeName>, ritter, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">häuptman</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Conradt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bilßtein</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">buwmeister</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lenge</unclear> nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verßtendiget</unclear>, wie das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear>, in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißerm</unclear> handel, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwern</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>burgern <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Balthaßarn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ferwern</unclear></persName>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear> landtmann <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bartholomäum</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>Dörig</persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berüerend</unclear>, üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">souil</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dermaaßen</unclear> bemüehet und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beflißen</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>habind, damit solcher zuo guoter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">endschafft</unclear> (wie dan <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschehen</unclear>) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khomen</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>möchte; <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alßo</unclear> nichts anders darinen befinden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">könen</unclear>, dan <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>alleß uß guoter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpärlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolmeinung</unclear> verhandlet
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syge</unclear> worden. Derhalben wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear> guoten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüw</unclear>-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">en</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpärn</unclear>, gantz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlichen</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hochfleißigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">danckh</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sagend</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>so wol der erzeigten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guothertzigkheit</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> der gehabten mühe. Be-
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stettigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demnach</unclear> auch für <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear> theil, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alleß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jenig</unclear>, so von üch,
<lb n="17"/>gegen den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßeren</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dißer</unclear> sachen halben, abgehandlet worden. Damit
<lb n="18"/>aber an unß auch nichts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ermanglete</unclear>, haben wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßrigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bartli</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>Dörigen, dahin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermügen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ale</unclear> sine sachen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißen</unclear> handel be-
<lb n="20"/>treffendt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> angezeigt und fürgestelt. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bij</unclear> dem wir aber nichts
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andereß</unclear> befunden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgschrifften</unclear>, deren er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allezyth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekantlich</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geweßen</unclear>; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölche</unclear> wirt er üch hiemit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">überantworten</unclear>. Ir
<lb n="23"/>werden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alßo</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kheinen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwüffel</unclear> stellen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betrieglicher</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüß</unclear> dahinden blibe; dan so wir dergleichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">itz</unclear>, oder in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khünfftigem</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>von ihme <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erfahren</unclear> wurden, solte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eß</unclear> ihme <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwißlich</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unstaten</unclear>,
<lb n="26"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">großem</unclear> schaden reichen. Derowegen bitten wir üch gantz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>-
<lb n="27"/>lich und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpärlich</unclear>, ir wellind gedachtem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßerm</unclear> landtmann Bar-
<lb n="28"/>tholomeo Dörig, die uß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkhantnuß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bemelte</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>sigel und brieff; auch andere sachen, so ihme <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuogehören</unclear>, und noch in
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üweres</unclear> burgers <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Balthaßars</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ferwers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">behaußung</unclear>, sein möchten
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ohnerzogenlich</unclear> zuostellen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>. Welches wir dan, in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear>-
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1496_5386.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glyhen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehreren</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründlich</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachparlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zůbeschuld</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>en, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zůverdienen</unclear>, so willig, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">urbietig</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Thůnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ans</unclear> hiemit
<lb n="34"/>mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">göttlicher</unclear> protection wol befelhen. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dathum</unclear> <origDate when="1606" resp="#ner">den. 16.ten
<lb n="35"/>februarij. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ao</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1606.ten</unclear></origDate>
<lb n="36"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-506" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Landtamman unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Raaht</unclear>
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zů</unclear> Appenzell</orgName>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">s</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1496_5387.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1496_5388.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="38"/>Denen frommen, fürsichtigen, ehrsamen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weisen</unclear>,
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hrn</unclear>. <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermeistern</unclear> und Raeth der Statt Sant Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="40"/>unsern insonders gueten fründen, und getrüwen
<lb n="41"/>lieben Nachbaren.
</p>
